! mcp_bootstrap_p324.strap -- MCP printed page 324: the LOADER (PUNID
! 22LOADER), a run of card processing from ALDA5 (bounds test against
! ALOWWD/AHGHWD), AFPCRD (the FORTRAN program card routine: ARCDCT
! card count, AFPCD1/AFPCD2), ARBNCD (relocatable binary card: origin,
! instruction count, relocation bits) to ARBCD4, lines 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.75, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22LOADER  CARD
! ID TA000196  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 324"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 234625, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines, all code, every line number printed with "*".
!   Contiguous from 234625.40 (line 1) to 234676.00 (line 56, a half
!   word; next location 234676.40).  "*" also stands after the LOCATION
!   on lines 13, 27 and 45.  Line 26 prints a stray "." between the
!   label AFPCD1 and SF.  Line 49 prints "ANUBIT-": the COMMENT MARK
!   (C28-6129 PDF p.5), written without it.  No TAIL is printed.
!
! JOIN.  pp.314-323 are not landed; p.313 (staged) ends at 234021.x, so
!   this page's join to p.323 is unchecked here.  p.325 should open at
!   234676.40 with serial TA000249.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 36 Z,$1 prints its last byte "C0" -- the same open round
!     this row prints in its octal field ("000C21.22"), and Z,$6 / Z,$7
!     on lines 35/37 print 00; the statement can only assemble 00
!     (brief rule 6).  Checked as 00.  (Line 15's BZAE "C0" and line
!     48's BAE "C2" are real C: they assemble so.)
!   * ALDCTR, ALOWWD, AFPCD1/AFPCD2, ARBCD4/6/7, ARCDCT print D (and O)
!     worn/open; spelled as p.291 (staged) and C22-6728 (AFPCRD, ARBNCD,
!     ARNRM1, ARBCD6, ARBCD7, ANORMR) spell them; AFPCD1/2 and ARBCD4
!     follow their families.  ALDA1's last glyph is a flagged 1 at
!     900 dpi, as in "$1" beside it.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Loader data (ALL .. AHGHWD) from p.291 (staged), KSILO
!   from landed p.171.  Branch targets ALDA1, AERR5A, ANORMR, ARNRM1,
!   AERR4, ACHSM, AERR8 and the SF targets ARBCD6/ARBCD7 are defined on
!   pages not landed: values from this page's binary only.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  TA000196 (line 1) .. TA000248 (line 56).  TA000225
!   prints on lines 30 AND 31; TA000229 on lines 35, 36 AND 37.  None
!   skipped.  Recorded, not explained.

